  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "For ideal solution formation spontaneously<br /><math> <mrow> <mo>&Delta;</mo> <mtext>G</mtext> </mrow> </math> is -ve<br /><math> <mrow> <mo>&Delta;</mo> <msub> <mtext>S</mtext> <mtext>system</mtext> </msub> </mrow> </math> is +ve &nbsp;(there will be three types of intereractions in solution rather two types of intereractions before forming the solution)<br />​<br /><math> <mrow> <mo>&Delta;</mo> <msub> <mtext>S</mtext> <mtext>surroundings</mtext> </msub> <mo>=</mo> <mn>0</mn> </mrow> </math> (no heat transfer from surroundings)<br /><math> <mrow> <mo>&Delta;</mo> <mtext>H</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mn>0</mn> </mrow> </math>",
